-- title:
--   Completion at the ramified place is unchanged by meeting with a conjugate
-- statement:
--   Let $a,b\in\mathbb{Q}$ and let $p$ be a prime, and assume [`QuaternionAlgebra.IsDefiniteRamifiedExactlyAt a b p`](def/QuaternionAlgebra_EichlerOrder.html#L87): that is, $a<0$, $b<0$, and for every height-one prime $v$ of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ the algebra $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_v$ has every nonzero element a unit precisely when $p$ lies in the prime ideal of $v$. Let $R$ be a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$ which is an Eichler order of level $M\in\mathbb{N}$, meaning that $R=\Lambda_1\cap\Lambda_2$ for two orders $\Lambda_1,\Lambda_2$ each maximal under inclusion among orders, with the relative index of the additive group of $R$ in that of $\Lambda_1$ equal to $M$. Let $u$ be a height-one prime of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ containing $p$, and let $m$ be a unit of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{A}_{\mathbb{Q}}^{\mathrm{fin}}$. Then the local box at $u$ of [`CerednikDrinfeld.meetOrder R m`](def/CerednikDrinfeld_ClassSetGraph.html#L15), namely of $R\cap\bigl(\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]\cap m\widehat{R}m^{-1}\bigr)$ (the intersection of $R$ with [`Submodule.conjByFiniteIdele R m`](def/Submodule_FiniteAdeleBox.html#L31)), equals the local box at $u$ of $R$; here the local box of $\Lambda$ at $u$ is the additive subgroup of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_u$ generated by the elements $z\otimes c$ with $z\in\Lambda$ and $c$ in the valuation ring of $\mathbb{Q}_u$.
--
--   At the unique ramified place the quaternion algebra is a division algebra, whose maximal order is unique and hence stable under all conjugations, so meeting an Eichler order with a conjugate of itself leaves its completion at that place untouched, whatever the level. The statement feeds the analysis of stabilisers and quotients in the Čerednik–Drinfel'd coset-graph description of the class set, being used by [`CerednikDrinfeld.CosetGraph.exists_quot_equiv_classSet_shift_forget_of_mumfordSideFrame`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.CosetGraph.exists_quot_equiv_classSet_shift_forget_of_mumfordSideFrame) and by [`CerednikDrinfeld.CosetGraph.finite_stabilizer_and_finite_quot_and_exists_equiv_classSet_of_mumfordSideFrame`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.CosetGraph.finite_stabilizer_and_finite_quot_and_exists_equiv_classSet_of_mumfordSideFrame).
